  "description": "ADO-VIEW membership under edits (read/write copy): on a client static batch-optimistic Recordset of SELECT ID, Code, L, S FROM T ORDER BY ID with Filter \"L = 20\" read RecordCount; AddNew with L 99 and Update (RecordCount, EOF, current ID, Status); AddNew with L 20 and Update (RecordCount, current ID, AbsolutePosition); change L of the current row to 21 and Update (RecordCount, current ID, AbsolutePosition, EOF); Delete the current row (RecordCount, current Status); Filter none (RecordCount and every ID and Status). Asks how added, changed and deleted rows enter or leave a filtered view and where the cursor moves.",
